# Language

The whole project is in English: code, comments, identifiers, docs, rules, commits, logs, UI copy, emails, API messages and agent text. Chat with the user may be in any language, but anything written to the repo is English.

Keep comments minimal and direct — explain non-obvious intent, not what the code already says.
